Source: https://github.com/MoonLadderStudios/MoonMind/tree/main/services/repository-security/rules
No third-party rule corpus is included.

Coverage is deliberately limited to Python dynamic evaluation and shell-enabled
subprocess calls, and JavaScript/TypeScript dynamic evaluation. These syntactic
checks flag risky APIs, not proven exploitability. They do not establish complete
security coverage or compliance with any framework. Review each finding in context.
